/datum/patron/divine/abyssor
	desc = "The seaborne's Primal Divine. When awakened, the world flooded for a thousand daes and a thousand nights before He was put to slumber. Tyrannical, abyssal, and ne'er to be understood - though those that follow the Deepest Will can court the currents in their favor."

/datum/patron/divine/astrata
	desc = "The Tyrant of the Gods, sister and counterpart to Noc. Greatest of the Living Gods. She, the Radiance, burns away the evils at bay during the dae; and has defined the rights of society for nearly two millenia."

/datum/patron/divine/noc
	desc = "The Reflective Will - and counterpart to Astrata, aside. In contrast to Solar Will, whose law and diction is absolute, Noc is best described as somewhere between a mirror and a conduit- offering wisdom, insight, wonder and thaumic empowerment to all who look upon them. They share freely what could be learned - and the only judgement cast is the onlooker's own."

/datum/patron/divine/undivided
	desc = "Five Eternal, Divine Pantheon United, Bulwark against the Darkness. The Five True Divines dilligently watch over their flock granting them potent boons, but not every man catches the attention of merely one. Take lessons from them all, for they are your masters and mentors."
	worshippers = "Commonfolk, Zybantines, Raneshani, the Clergy, and Nobility"
	confess_lines = list(
		"THE HOLY PENTACLE SHALL SHIELD MY SOUL!",
		"I SERVE THE PANTHEON RESPLENDENT!",
		"THE FIVE ETERNAL, FOREVERMORE!",
	)
	titles = list(
		"Gods"
	)
